<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-WESTERN AUSTRALIA 170 ALL OUT V WEST INDIES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WESTERN AUSTRALIA 170 ALL OUT V WEST INDIES.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Australia were bowled out</p>
<p>for 170 in the second innings of their three-day match against</p>
<p>West Indies at the WACA on Sunday.</p>
<p>Score - Western Australia 293 for six declared and 170 (Carl</p>
<p>Hooper four for 59). West Indies 441 for five declared</p>
<p>(Shivnarine Chanderpaul 135 not out, Robert Samuels 96, Carl</p>
<p>Hooper 84, Roland Holder 68).</p>
</text>
